# The MCP launcher is two files behind one extensionless name (#900531): cl-mcp.cmd
# (cmd.exe; LF-only, which is why it uses no labels -- cmd.exe mis-seeks them in LF files)
# and cl-mcp (#!/bin/sh; sh chokes on CR). core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout would
# otherwise give the extensionless file CRLF, so it is pinned by name.
*.cmd text eol=lf
plugins/crossloom/bin/cl-mcp text eol=lf
